#: ImportDialog.cc:41
msgid "KWord's MS Write Import Filter"
msgstr "Passete MS-Write d' intrêye po KWord"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "MS Write Import Dialog"
msgstr "Purnea d' abagaedje MS-Write"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "&Encoding"
msgstr "&Ecôdaedje"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid ""
"Select the encoding of the Write document."
"<br><br>Try the Default  Encoding (CP 1252), if unsure."
msgstr ""
"Tchoezixhoz l' ecôdaedje eployî på documint MS-Write. "
"<br><br>Si vos n' savoz nén, tchoezixhoz li prémetou ecôdaedje (CP 1252)."

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "&Other encoding:"
msgstr "&Ôtès ecôdaedjes:"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "&Default encoding (CP 1252)"
msgstr "&Prémetou ecôdaedje (CP 1252)"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"Most Write documents are stored using this encoding (also known as "
"windows-1252).<br><br>Select this if unsure."
msgstr ""
"Li plupårt des documints MS-Write sont scrîts avou cist ecôdaedje chal "
"(ossu lomé windows-1252). "
"<br><br>Tchoezixhoz çouchal si vos n' estoz nén seur."

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&Advanced"
msgstr "&Sipepieus"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid ""
"These advanced options allow you to fine-tune the importing of formatting "
"information. They compensate for differences between KWord and MS Write by "
"adding extra formatting information (not found in the original document), to "
"try to make the imported document look as close to the original as "
"possible.<br><br>It is safe to use the defaults, if unsure."
msgstr ""
"Ces spepieusès tchuzes chal vos permetèt d' apontyî finmint "
"l' epådjnaedje del informåcion. Ele compinsèt les diferinces k' i gn a "
"inte KWord eyet MS-Write på radjoutaedje d' informåcions d' epådjnaedje "
"(ki n' si trovèt nén e documint d' oridjinne), po sayî ki l' abagué "
"documint ravize li pus possibe l' oridjinnå."
"<br>"
"<br>C' est ene boune idêye di leyî les prémetowès valixhances, si vos "
"n' estoz nén seur di çou k' vos fjhoz."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Compensate for &linespacing differences"
msgstr "Compinser les diferinces d' espåce inte les &royes"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid ""
"Try to simulate Write's linespacing by adding some spaces before each "
"paragraph."
msgstr ""
"Saye di simuler l' espåce vude inte les hagnons k' ont voet avou MS-Write "
"tot radjoutant sacwants espåces divant tchaeke hagnon."

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Enable &image positioning"
msgstr "Mete en ouve li plaeçmint des &imådjes"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "Use paragraph indentation to position images."
msgstr "Eployî l' indintåcion des hagnons po plaecî les imådjes."

